WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Tiles arrive, each with its own checksum.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A damaged tile fails its check, is refused, and is requested again.

3
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.000
A damaged tile is refused and requested again; the receiver ends with exactly the original pixels. Demonstrated in simulation.

